// Purpose: Common subexpression test for TAC generation and future optimizations.
//
// What it Tests:
//  - Repeated identical subexpressions: 'b * c' evaluated multiple times.
//  - Validates baseline unoptimized TAC generation:
//      t1 = b * c
//      a = t1
//      t2 = b * c
//      t3 = a + t2
